<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified cross-border strikes, hitting a Hezbollah weapons shipment in the eastern Beqaa Valley and demolishing a Hezbollah tunnel in southern Lebanon, while a low-flying Israeli drone was filmed over homes in the south. US envoy Waltz visited Beirut demanding Hezbollah disarmament and condemning recent attacks. Iraq deployed its army to a stronghold of Iran-backed Kataib Hezbollah, linking the broader regional fight to the Israel-Hezbollah clash. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE50VGFwV05SZFlob1RXRWk4U0hnRkhYd1VwazNTWlZZTVVyTTAtdlp5bm5jeDdqRC1POGxsUDNDNW1vZDRrNHV4Nm90c2lta0dIR01UQkwwcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQV21RWWVYdWFod01WNnMycV9tb1RhLUNPVTRQZERqRDRYaXhuLVpVYTJxZWlObmpDWVRxQk5zVVhHTjZ5VXFtSjVHb1lqek1XUEFQS0FmYWxSYXp6YzdORTRnQmgyak11MkxuOU9acGwtY0pKX2ROZzBQdmxoTVZtZkFEWUpKb3kzZ0NZRGYwUlJTQWFIRUpaSTVVTVlrRHRzMVZfMVJyakgyd0lHeGVUd2RYcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNazVnNWlWVGxlSDV3VGl6QUdCamNPZWhZeHVLVFBjLU1PTUhTYXpzSkdGekh4b3ZneXVwMGNjQk5oNkcwZFhjMDVWNXBPUlVUVHBzSnc3cHBaUHkwR1pkVUV2U25ucUdOTzB5bG4wOUtsSDl6c3B1dWpXVl9rV0tsRzFsdVlRMEpvRW1N?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOb0xIQUpsVXpkajhmRWZYNGVQSWRORDZjVm1UcDU0dTFteVh1b09JWTNjcVRuUTRFVDhaZF9FUElKRkNGa2M